# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002219> (surrounded by)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002219> "x surrounded_by y if and only if (1) x is adjacent to y and for every region r that is adjacent to x, r overlaps y (2) the shared boundary between x and y occupies the majority of the outermost boundary of x")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002219> "surrounded by"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002219> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002220>)
