AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002588> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/valid_for_go_ontology>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002588> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/valid_for_gocam>)
