AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0003001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ro/subsets#ro-eco>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0003001> "produced by"@en)
