AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005635> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/go#goslim_plant>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005635> "nuclear envelope")
