AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "thefreedictionary.com:thefreedictionary.com") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000411> "A shape quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being such that every part of the surface or the circumference is equidistant from the center.")
