# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002309> (fiber shaped)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PATOC:DC") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002309> "A convex 3-D shape quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's exhibiting a by virtue of the bearer's exhibiting a consistently sized and approximately round cross-section along its length, which is many times larger than its diameter.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#creation_date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002309> "2011-09-09T04:50:10Z")
