AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0006984> "Old definition: 'Non-material anatomical entity of two dimensions, that is demarcated by anatomical lines or points on the external or internal surfaces of anatomical structures.' Note, in the new definition, the space referred to is not necessarily an anatomical space. It may be the outside of an organism.")
